      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Lecture 1: Introduction to Operating Systems:\n\n-> Compiler produces operating system dependent output files\n-> OS performs:\n    Resource Management\n    Process Management\n    Memory Management\n    Provides Security for the Hardware\n    Acts as Interface b/w hardware and processes\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Lecture 1: Introduction to Operating Systems:\n\n-> Compiler produces operating system dependent output files\n-> OS performs:\n    Resource Management\n    Process Management\n    Memory Management\n    Provides Security for the Hardware\n    Acts as Interface b/w hardware and processes\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
